      "7f441d74-8a38-4bec-bc12-3073409547d0"],
     " of them for a family of alternatives (the DAGs of a line or a ray, the \
atoms of a circle) or for the pieces of a polyline"
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"0b372ebb-a110-4f4d-ba2c-ce98ad1e8b80"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "671fbd8b-6c67-453f-aad7-724d6555c9b8"], Cell[TextData[Cell[
    BoxData["\"\<Cardinality\>\""], "InlineFormula",
